  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Native read-path optimizations: the shard/LRU hasher moves from SipHash to ahash (faster hashing), and every read looks the key up by a borrowed slice/&str instead of allocating an owned copy per call. ~25% lower hit latency in a same-machine A/B micro-benchmark (TryGet and GetString), with no API or behavior changes. Requires the 2.5.0 native binaries.",
